"maloon.workflow.daily-operations.title" = "Daily operations brief";
"maloon.workflow.daily-operations.summary" = "Today's jobs, progress, staffing gaps, upcoming work, and issues needing attention.";
"maloon.workflow.daily-operations.behavior" = "Read-only operational summary";
"maloon.workflow.daily-operations.objective" = "Prepare a concise owner operations brief for the snapshot's local date. Cover today's jobs and completion progress, unassigned or at-risk work, staffing concerns, and important jobs coming up in the next 14 days. Separate facts from recommendations, prioritize concrete owner actions, and cite the relevant job or assignment details. Do not treat incomplete data as proof that work was not done.";

"maloon.workflow.quote-follow-ups.title" = "Quote follow-ups";
"maloon.workflow.quote-follow-ups.summary" = "Find open quotes needing attention and draft follow-ups for owner review.";
"maloon.workflow.quote-follow-ups.behavior" = "Drafts only · nothing is sent";
"maloon.workflow.quote-follow-ups.objective" = "Review the draft and sent quotes in the snapshot. Prioritize quotes that need owner attention using their status, age, value, and supplied notes. Explain each recommendation and draft concise, courteous follow-up messages where useful. Clearly label every message as a draft for owner review. Do not send messages, change quote statuses, or invent customer history.";

"maloon.workflow.staffing-dispatch.title" = "Staffing and dispatch review";
"maloon.workflow.staffing-dispatch.summary" = "Flag unassigned or at-risk jobs and review options against worker availability.";
"maloon.workflow.staffing-dispatch.behavior" = "Recommendations only · no schedule changes";
"maloon.workflow.staffing-dispatch.objective" = "Review current and upcoming jobs, assignments, and active worker availability in the snapshot. Flag unassigned work, scheduling risks, and potential overloads or gaps. Suggest practical staffing or dispatch options only when supported by the supplied availability and assignment data. State uncertainty and never claim to have assigned workers or changed a schedule.";

"maloon.workflow.customer-marketing.title" = "Customer and marketing drafts";
"maloon.workflow.customer-marketing.summary" = "Draft useful customer communications and service marketing from current business context.";
"maloon.workflow.customer-marketing.behavior" = "Drafts only · nothing is published";
"maloon.workflow.customer-marketing.objective" = "Using only the supplied business, service, quote, and job context, propose a small set of useful customer communications and marketing drafts. Ground service descriptions and prices in the snapshot, keep claims supportable, and identify the intended audience and channel for each draft. Do not publish, send, invent testimonials, or make guarantees that are not present in the source data.";
